  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Papua New Guinea Bougainville Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Papua New Guinea (PNG) Bougainville Program utilizes a placed-based approach to coordinate and deliver Australian Government support in the Autonomous Region of Bougainville.  This program s one of three place-based program components under the Australia-Papua New Guinea subnational Program (APSP). The Bougainville program focuses on institutional capacity building, economic empowerment and community development
to support the emergence of a more stable community where citizens increasingly participate in, and benefit from political, social, and economic development.</narrative>
  </description>
